From: Ricardo Salveti <ricardo.salveti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:41:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: refresh the CMA patches for 0.8.0

meta-openembedded ed9e27985051 ("libcamera: upgrade 0.7.2 -> 0.8.0")
breaks do_patch: the two software ISP CMA patches were adapted to
0.7.2, and 0.8.0 reworked the simple pipeline's software ISP selection.

Replace them with the v2 series as posted upstream, which is based on
the code 0.8.0 ships and applies without changes.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://lists.libcamera.org/pipermail/libcamera-devel/2026-October/063202.html]

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Ricardo Salveti <ricardo.salveti@oss.qualcomm.com>
